currently participating on wyoming promise the board of wyoming promised that its sole purpose is to is to address and have ratified to our constitution the idea that uh that individual people are or corporations are have the same rights as individual people when it comes to elections and um this this was an easy effort for me to get involved in because of my belief and those that i talked to about the amount of money in our politics currently now and um primarily the issue for me is that it's it's not traceable we don't know where the money may come from and we know already in wyoming and certain parts of the state that dark money has dramatically affected elections in wyoming money that can be from foreign nations or whatever sources there might be without tracking them it's a bipartisan issue as folks may know that there was a huge effort in the recent elections in georgia for the senate uh

