it was kind of a distraction from what our goal setting was that we had said in january so therefore i signed the petition when it was presented to me as an in an individual but i'm not a constitutional scholar to go into the citizens united case but i just thought that this was a distraction that we should uh be focusing on more important things in the city that we had agreed upon and have something going through the legislature before we put through a resolution thank you mr johnson anyone else like to speak mr mayor dr rennie i tend to agree with the councilman from ward 3. i think this is citizens united decision was a disservice to the country's citizens and

